    },
    {
      "id": "cr_e1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000029",
      "type": "note",
      "kind": "rumour",
      "name": "A log line left blank",
      "summary": "A rumour at Dentus says a scout ship left with a blank line in the log.",
      "details": "The rumour a crew might hear is thin: a scout ship at Dentus departed with one log line left blank. The referee's version is that Harun Peck asked for the blank line and passed the time of departure to Wynn Solas. What the ship carried is the referee's call. Dentus has a scout base, so a scout ship at the port is ordinary.",
      "tags": [
        "example"
      ],
